== 0. the grant the storefront gives the assistant
{
  "aud": "harbor-assistant",
  "azp": "harbor-storefront",
  "scope": "openid delegation:client:harbor-assistant profile",
  "may_act": {
    "sub": "111b6b71-0749-4528-9dd5-e4f602b8e3ff",
    "client_id": "harbor-assistant"
  }
}
the grant sent straight to Harbor: 401 audience mismatch

== 1. the assistant's own token (client credentials)
POST /realms/harbor/protocol/openid-connect/token HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8080
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: Basic <client_id:client_secret>

grant_type=client_credentials

HTTP/1.1 200 OK
cache-control: no-store
content-type: application/json

{
  "access_token": "<JWT 762 chars>",
  "expires_in": 300,
  "refresh_expires_in": 0,
  "token_type": "Bearer",
  "not-before-policy": 0,
  "scope": ""
}

== 2. token exchange: Rosa's grant in, a delegated token out
POST /realms/harbor/protocol/openid-connect/token HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8080
DPoP: <JWT 508 chars>
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: Basic <client_id:client_secret>

grant_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:token-exchange&
subject_token=<JWT 1179 chars>&
subject_token_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:token-type:access_token&
actor_token=<JWT 762 chars>&
actor_token_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:token-type:access_token&
scope=orders:read

HTTP/1.1 200 OK
cache-control: no-store
content-type: application/json

