== 4. a thief with the token but not the key
GET /orders/ord-5003 HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8008
Authorization: Bearer <JWT 1066 chars>

HTTP/1.1 401 Unauthorized
content-type: application/problem+json
www-authenticate: DPoP resource_metadata="http://127.0.0.1:8008/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource", error="invalid_token", error_description="DPoP-bound token sent without a DPoP proof", algs="ES256"

{
  "type": "https://harbor.example/problems/unauthorized",
  "title": "Unauthorized",
  "status": 401,
  "detail": "DPoP-bound token sent without a DPoP proof"
}

replayed proof: 401 proof already used

== 5. the delegated token tries to cancel the order
403 DPoP resource_metadata="http://127.0.0.1:8008/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource", error="insufficient_scope", error_description="PUT /orders/ord-5003/cancellation needs orders:write", scope="orders:write", algs="ES256"
